{#- The Airbnb rating on a home card. Expects `rating` from the airbnbRating filter (null renders nothing).
    ratingPart "badge": the visible badge on the card photo, hidden from screen readers.
    ratingPart "spoken": the sentence a screen reader hears, placed right after the home's name.
    Score and count are separate spans so a narrow card can stack them. -#}
{%- if rating -%}
{%- if ratingPart == "spoken" -%}<span class="g-sr-only">{{ rating.spoken }}</span>
{%- else -%}<div class="g-card-rating" aria-hidden="true"><span class="g-card-rating-score">★ {{ rating.score }}</span>{% if rating.count %}<span class="g-card-rating-sep"> · </span><span class="g-card-rating-count">{{ rating.count }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
